{"id":"n59474-3-5","stage":1,"title":"끓이다 · 心急如焚","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59474-3-5-1","ko":"아버지가 왜 저렇게 화를 끓이고 계시지?","zh":"爸爸为什么气得那么厉害啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지가","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지가","audio":"/audio/d410a34c6ee94b9d6f70.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저렇게","audio":"/audio/3e51b4147d3689f85089.mp3"}},{"text":"화를","meaning":"火，气","explanation":"화：火，气；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"화","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74134","senseId":"1","lemma":"화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화를","audio":"/audio/796488caaf79e93bb6ec.mp3"}},{"text":"끓이고","meaning":"心急如焚，担惊受怕，焦虑","explanation":"끓이다：心急如焚，担惊受怕，焦虑；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끓이다","audio":"/audio/e0e928624bcebfda14ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59474","senseId":"3","lemma":"끓이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끓이고","audio":"/audio/b2386c7f868283adc2c0.mp3"}},{"text":"계시지?","meaning":"(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61346","senseId":"2","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계시지","audio":"/audio/4ec0b47e0656ad281e64.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"950afe85bf406364","term":"화","zh":"火，气","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3","entryId":"74134","definition":"十分不满意或恼怒的情绪。","pronunciation":["화ː"]},{"id":"e0e928624bcebfda","term":"끓이다","zh":"心急如焚，担惊受怕，焦虑","audio":"/audio/e0e928624bcebfda14ca.mp3","entryId":"59474","definition":"由于担心或费神而产生激动的情绪。","pronunciation":["끄리다"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"61346","definition":"(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9a7844bf96524a83b90.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59474-3-5-2","ko":"하시려던 일이 뜻대로 안 되니까 그렇지.","zh":"因为他想做的事没有如愿以偿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하시려던","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；려던：表示过去正打算做的动作，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하시려던","audio":"/audio/b03098bf4d3aa5da8cbc.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","a